CM 6m Yagi 
CM Design by Greg Mew VK4GRM
CM Simple 3 Element Yagi design optimised for 50 ohm feed.  
CM Bandwidth 50 to 54MHz
CM Optimised design for three elements with low SWR
CM Based on 6mYagi-Opt13-1MHz with Reflector fixed in length to 3m and dimensions rounded to the mm.
CM Maximum Boom length 1.0m
CM Model to be run in 4nec2 using NEC2
CE
SY FREQ=50.313			'Centre Frequency
SY WL=300/FREQ			'Wavelength is 300/Frequency
SY DE_LEN=2.871			'Start driven element length 0.5 x WL
SY REF=3.0			'Reflector length fixed
SY REF_Sep=0.357		'Reflector separation from Driven Element
SY DIR1=2.687			'Director 1 length
SY DIR1_Sep=0.297		'Director 1 separation from DE
SY WIRE_RAD=0.005		'Dipole Radius
SY HEIGHT=0

GW	1	29	0		-DE_LEN/2	HEIGHT	0		DE_LEN/2	HEIGHT	WIRE_RAD 	'Driven Element 
GW	2	29	-REF_Sep	-REF/2		HEIGHT	-REF_SEP	REF/2		HEIGHT	WIRE_RAD	'Reflector
GW	3	29	DIR1_Sep	-DIR1/2		HEIGHT	DIR1_Sep	DIR1/2		HEIGHT	WIRE_RAD	'Director

GE	0								'No ground plane present
EK									'Initiates use of extended thin wire kernal			

LD	5	0	0	0	3.69E+07			'Set all materials to aluminium


EX	0	1	15	0	1	0			'Specifies excitation for the Driven Element
FR	0	41	0	0	50	0.1			'Specifies the frequency of operation
RP	0	361	361	1000	0	0	1	1	'Specifies the radiation pattern sampling parameters
EN									'End of data entry
